    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classNeoN_1_1la_1_1Solver" kindref="compound">Solver</ref> for block-coupled linear systems that calls Ginkgo directly with zero-copy views. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Unlike the free function la::solve() which deep-copies through <ref refid="namespaceNeoN_1_1la_1ac19cc6fa4f17dd75962891309709bca8" kindref="member">toCSR()</ref> and <ref refid="classNeoN_1_1la_1_1LinearSystem" kindref="compound">LinearSystem</ref>, <ref refid="classNeoN_1_1la_1_1BlockSolver" kindref="compound">BlockSolver</ref> wraps BlockMatrix/BlockVector data directly into Ginkgo arrays and matrices without any intermediate copies. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
